<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18935] Late stopping of TTL workers during deactivation leads to corrupted PDS</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18935</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Step to reproduce&lt;br/&gt;
1. Reduce wal history size and wal segment size to 16MB and 8MB respectively, set checkpoint frequency to 10000&lt;br/&gt;
2. Perform heavy load with a lot of entries with TTL 5000 and with eager ttl enabled&lt;br/&gt;
3. Perform deactivation of cluster, stop grid and restart, provided that an expiration process is active during the process of restart.&lt;/p&gt;

